WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.217
Give the board a title and pick a retro format.

2
00:00:04.221 --> 00:00:08.679
The facilitator picks the theme and the whole team sees it.

3
00:00:14.964 --> 00:00:19.331
The Share panel gives the link, the code and the QR code.

4
00:00:19.339 --> 00:00:23.752
Each column has its own field, drafts stay on your device.

5
00:00:23.766 --> 00:00:27.863
The ring shows the running phase and the time left.

6
00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:32.585
The agenda panel starts, skips to the next phase or extends.

7
00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:37.120
The participant list shows who is online and their role.

8
00:00:37.314 --> 00:00:41.321
The board chat is encrypted like everything else.

9
00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:45.648
Add an action, give it an owner and a due date.

10
00:00:46.014 --> 00:00:49.886
Presentation mode enlarges the current column.

11
00:00:50.773 --> 00:00:55.591
The report gathers the podium, the ideas by column and the actions.

12
00:00:55.931 --> 00:01:00.209
Options set the votes, the lock and who can facilitate.
